-- Chương VI and the whole physical damage answer. Expected values are worked from the source by
-- hand. The car: registered May 2021, contract 1 June 2024, so 37 months of use and 15%
-- depreciation on spare parts (Điều 18.1.2(b), second row, not for business).

§ `Chương VI — the clauses one by one`

#ASSERT `chapter VI — an additional clause may be added` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `chapter VI — an additional clause may be added` FALSE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `chapter VI — an additional clause may be added` TRUE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `BS01 — depreciation applies under` `cover with BS01`
#ASSERT `BS01 — depreciation applies under` `cover of 500 million at full value`
#ASSERT `BS02 — Tasco accepts the repairer's cost` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `BS02 — Tasco accepts the repairer's cost` TRUE TRUE FALSE
-- BS03: 10% of 20,000,000 is below the 3,000,000 floor; of 50,000,000 it is 5,000,000.
#ASSERT `BS03 — the deductible on` 20_000_000 EQUALS 3_000_000
#ASSERT `BS03 — the deductible on` 50_000_000 EQUALS 5_000_000
#ASSERT `BS03 — buys back the flood-water exclusion` `cover with BS03` `a flooded engine` `in operation in the flood`
#ASSERT NOT `BS03 — buys back the flood-water exclusion` `cover with BS03` `a flooded engine` `no additional-clause facts`
#ASSERT NOT `BS03 — buys back the flood-water exclusion` `cover with BS03` `a flooded electric motor` `in operation in the flood`
-- BS04: 2 thefts for 12-18 months, 3 above 18, none stated under 12 (finding X22).
#ASSERT `BS04 — the most thefts paid under a contract of` 12 EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `BS04 — the most thefts paid under a contract of` 18 EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `BS04 — the most thefts paid under a contract of` 19 EQUALS 3
#ASSERT REFUSED `BS04 — the most thefts paid under a contract of` 11 BECAUSE "BS04 sets no limit on the number of thefts for a contract of under 12 months"
#ASSERT `BS04 — covers the theft of parts` `cover with BS04` `one theft already paid`
#ASSERT NOT `BS04 — covers the theft of parts` `cover with BS04` `two thefts already paid`
#ASSERT NOT `BS04 — covers the theft of parts` `cover with BS04` `keys stolen`
#ASSERT REFUSED `BS04 — covers the theft of parts` `cover with BS04, for 11 months` `one theft already paid`
#ASSERT `BS04 — the deductible on` 5_000_000 EQUALS 1_000_000
#ASSERT `BS04 — the deductible on` 20_000_000 EQUALS 2_000_000
-- BS05.
#ASSERT `BS05 — buys back the outside-Vietnam exclusion` `cover with BS05` `a collision in Laos` `in a named country, with a permit`
#ASSERT NOT `BS05 — buys back the outside-Vietnam exclusion` `cover with BS05` `a collision in Laos` `no additional-clause facts`
#ASSERT `BS05 — theft abroad` `a theft of the car in Laos`
-- BS06.
#ASSERT `BS06 — the vehicle may hold the clause` `a duty-free car insured at 400 million before taxes`
#ASSERT `BS06 — the total loss payable` `a duty-free car insured at 400 million before taxes` EQUALS 400_000_000
#ASSERT `BS06 — a partial loss may be paid` `no additional-clause facts`
-- BS07: fewer than 9 seats, private, carrying people.
#ASSERT `BS07 — the vehicle may hold the clause` `a private car registered in May 2021`
#ASSERT NOT `BS07 — the vehicle may hold the clause` `a 9-seat private car`
#ASSERT NOT `BS07 — the vehicle may hold the clause` `a taxi`
-- Ten days of hire at 600,000 a day, the vehicle held on day 6: days 1-4 are the deductible,
-- day 6 is not paid; days 5, 7, 8, 9 and 10 are paid at the 500,000 cap: 2,500,000. With 28 of
-- the year's 30 days already paid, only days 5 and 7: 1,000,000.
#ASSERT `BS07 — the hire costs payable` (LIST `hire day 1`, `hire day 2`, `hire day 3`, `hire day 4`, `hire day 5`, `hire day 6`, `hire day 7`, `hire day 8`, `hire day 9`, `hire day 10`) 0 EQUALS 2_500_000
#ASSERT `BS07 — the hire costs payable` (LIST `hire day 1`, `hire day 2`, `hire day 3`, `hire day 4`, `hire day 5`, `hire day 6`, `hire day 7`, `hire day 8`, `hire day 9`, `hire day 10`) 28 EQUALS 1_000_000
-- BS08: at most 30 days unless agreed in writing.
#ASSERT `BS08 — the clause covers the vehicle` `a new car in transit for 20 days`
#ASSERT NOT `BS08 — the clause covers the vehicle` `a new car in transit for 31 days`
#ASSERT `BS08 — the clause covers the vehicle` `a new car in transit for 31 days, agreed in writing`
-- BS09: an airport qualifies the vehicle, but the benefit does not name it (finding X23).
#ASSERT `BS09 — the vehicle may hold the clause` `a forklift at an airport`
#ASSERT NOT `BS09 — the loss is at a site the benefit names` `a forklift at an airport`
#ASSERT `BS09 — the loss is at a site the benefit names` `a forklift in a warehouse`
-- BS10.
#ASSERT `BS10 — the vehicle may hold the clause` `a training car with no instructor aboard`
#ASSERT `BS10 — no instructor or no auxiliary brake` `a training car with no instructor aboard`
#ASSERT NOT `BS10 — no instructor or no auxiliary brake` `no additional-clause facts`
-- BS11: the item is paid up to its own sum insured: 10,000,000 of 15,000,000.
#ASSERT `BS11 — the payment for the lost item` `a declared item of 10 million costing 15 million to replace` EQUALS 10_000_000
#ASSERT `BS11 — buys back the added-equipment exclusion` `cover with BS11` `a declared item of 10 million costing 15 million to replace`
#ASSERT NOT `BS11 — buys back the added-equipment exclusion` `cover with BS11` `no additional-clause facts`
-- BS12.
#ASSERT `BS12 — buys back the riot exclusion` `cover with BS12` `riot damage`
#ASSERT NOT `BS12 — buys back the riot exclusion` `cover with BS12` `riot damage with a bomb`
-- BS13.
#ASSERT `BS13 — buys back the special-equipment exclusion` `cover with BS13` `a loss from its own special equipment` `no additional-clause facts`
#ASSERT NOT `BS13 — buys back the special-equipment exclusion` `cover with BS13` `a loss from its own special equipment` `an unsafe special vehicle`
-- BS14.
#ASSERT `BS14 — the vehicle may hold the clause` `a lorry` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `BS14 — the vehicle may hold the clause` `a lorry` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `BS14 — the vehicle may hold the clause` `a private car registered in May 2021` TRUE
#ASSERT `BS14 — the damage to the goods is covered` TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `BS14 — the damage to the goods is covered` TRUE TRUE TRUE
-- BS15: an electric car under 72 months.
#ASSERT `BS15 — the vehicle may hold the clause` `an electric car registered in May 2021` 71
#ASSERT NOT `BS15 — the vehicle may hold the clause` `an electric car registered in May 2021` 72
#ASSERT NOT `BS15 — the vehicle may hold the clause` `a private car registered in May 2021` 37
#ASSERT `BS15 — the deductible on` 300_000_000 EQUALS 30_000_000
#ASSERT `BS15 — the deductible on` 20_000_000 EQUALS 3_000_000
-- The battery on a 37-month electric car, not for business: 300,000,000 less 30% = 210,000,000;
-- less the BS15 deductible of 21,000,000 = 189,000,000.
#ASSERT `BS15 — the answer on the battery` `a contract on an electric car` `cover with BS15` `a collision damaging battery and bumper` `no additional-clause facts` EQUALS `payable` 189_000_000
#ASSERT `BS15 — the answer on the battery` `a contract on an electric car` `cover with BS15` `a collision damaging the battery alone` `no additional-clause facts` EQUALS `excluded` (LIST `BS15 battery damaged alone`)
#ASSERT `BS15 — the answer on the battery` `a contract on an electric car` `cover with BS15` `a collision damaging battery and bumper` `a non-genuine battery` EQUALS `excluded` (LIST `BS15 battery not genuine`)
#ASSERT `BS15 — the answer on the battery` `a contract on an electric car` `cover of 500 million at full value` `a collision damaging battery and bumper` `no additional-clause facts` EQUALS `outside the cover` "BS15 is not held"
-- X24: without BS15, Chương II pays the same battery: 210,000,000 + the bumper 17,000,000 =
-- 227,000,000, less the 500,000 of Điều 19 = 226,500,000. BS15's own deductible on the battery
-- is 21,000,000.
#ASSERT `the answer on the physical damage claim` `a contract on an electric car` `cover of 500 million at full value` `a collision damaging battery and bumper` `no additional-clause facts` EQUALS `payable` 226_500_000

