§ `The whole physical damage answer`

-- A collision: 17,000,000 (bumper, 15% off) + 5,000,000 (door) = 22,000,000; less 500,000 =
-- 21,500,000; plus costs 1,000,000 + 3,000,000 = 25,500,000.
#ASSERT `the answer on the physical damage claim` `a contract for a year from 1 June 2024, paid on signing` `cover of 500 million at full value` `a collision on 1 September 2024` `no additional-clause facts` EQUALS `payable` 25_500_000
-- Under-insured, 400 of 500 million: 22,000,000 x 0.8 = 17,600,000; less 500,000 = 17,100,000;
-- plus 4,000,000 = 21,100,000.
#ASSERT `the answer on the physical damage claim` `a contract for a year from 1 June 2024, paid on signing` `cover of 400 million on a car worth 500 million, for the claim` `a collision on 1 September 2024` `no additional-clause facts` EQUALS `payable` 21_100_000
-- BS01: no depreciation: 25,000,000 - 500,000 + 4,000,000 = 28,500,000.
#ASSERT `the answer on the physical damage claim` `a contract for a year from 1 June 2024, paid on signing` `cover with BS01` `a collision on 1 September 2024` `no additional-clause facts` EQUALS `payable` 28_500_000
-- Late notice: 21,500,000 x 90% = 19,350,000; plus 4,000,000 = 23,350,000.
#ASSERT `the answer on the physical damage claim` `a contract for a year from 1 June 2024, paid on signing` `cover of 500 million at full value` `a collision with late notice` `no additional-clause facts` EQUALS `payable` 23_350_000
-- Total loss: repair 340 of 450 million: 450,000,000 + 4,000,000 = 454,000,000. Keeping the
-- wreck at 50,000,000: 404,000,000.
#ASSERT `the answer on the physical damage claim` `a contract for a year from 1 June 2024, paid on signing` `cover of 500 million at full value` `a collision writing the car off` `no additional-clause facts` EQUALS `payable` 454_000_000
#ASSERT `the answer on the physical damage claim` `a contract for a year from 1 June 2024, paid on signing` `cover of 500 million at full value` `a collision writing the car off, the owner keeping the wreck` `no additional-clause facts` EQUALS `payable` 404_000_000
-- Theft of the car: 450,000,000 once the police conclude; until then, not yet.
#ASSERT `the answer on the physical damage claim` `a contract for a year from 1 June 2024, paid on signing` `cover of 500 million at full value` `a theft of the car, police concluded` `no additional-clause facts` EQUALS `payable` 450_000_000
#ASSERT `the answer on the physical damage claim` `a contract for a year from 1 June 2024, paid on signing` `cover of 500 million at full value` `a theft of the car, police not concluded` `no additional-clause facts` EQUALS `not yet payable` "art 18.2.2: the police have not concluded by suspending the investigation or prosecution"
-- Outside the period; outside the kinds of vehicle.
#ASSERT `the answer on the physical damage claim` `a contract for a year from 1 June 2024, paid on signing` `cover of 500 million at full value` `a collision before the period` `no additional-clause facts` EQUALS `outside the cover` "art 1-3: the contract had no effect on the day of the loss"
#ASSERT `the answer on the physical damage claim` `a contract on a motorcycle` `cover of 500 million at full value` `a collision on 1 September 2024` `no additional-clause facts` EQUALS `outside the cover` "opening paragraph: the rules apply to cars, tractors and trailers drawn by them"
-- Riot: excluded (11.9) without BS12; paid with it (25,500,000); a bomb stays excluded.
#ASSERT `the answer on the physical damage claim` `a contract for a year from 1 June 2024, paid on signing` `cover of 500 million at full value` `riot damage` `no additional-clause facts` EQUALS `excluded` (LIST `art 11.9 war, terrorism, riot or explosives`)
#ASSERT `the answer on the physical damage claim` `a contract for a year from 1 June 2024, paid on signing` `cover with BS12` `riot damage` `no additional-clause facts` EQUALS `payable` 25_500_000
#ASSERT `the answer on the physical damage claim` `a contract for a year from 1 June 2024, paid on signing` `cover with BS12` `riot damage with a bomb` `no additional-clause facts` EQUALS `excluded` (LIST `art 11.9 war, terrorism, riot or explosives`, `BS12 bombs or explosive devices`)
-- Water hammer: excluded (15.2) without BS03; with it, 50,000,000 less BS03's 5,000,000, plus
-- 4,000,000 = 49,000,000. An electric car's flooded motor stays excluded under BS03 (finding X21).
#ASSERT `the answer on the physical damage claim` `a contract for a year from 1 June 2024, paid on signing` `cover of 500 million at full value` `a flooded engine` `in operation in the flood` EQUALS `excluded` (LIST `art 15.2 engine damage in flood water`)
#ASSERT `the answer on the physical damage claim` `a contract for a year from 1 June 2024, paid on signing` `cover with BS03` `a flooded engine` `in operation in the flood` EQUALS `payable` 49_000_000
#ASSERT `the answer on the physical damage claim` `a contract on an electric car` `cover with BS03` `a flooded electric motor` `in operation in the flood` EQUALS `excluded` (LIST `art 15.2 engine damage in flood water`)
-- Theft of a part: excluded (15.4) without BS04; with it, 17,000,000 (15% off) less BS04's
-- 1,700,000 = 15,300,000.
#ASSERT `the answer on the physical damage claim` `a contract for a year from 1 June 2024, paid on signing` `cover of 500 million at full value` `a stolen mirror` `no additional-clause facts` EQUALS `excluded` (LIST `art 15.4 theft of parts`)
#ASSERT `the answer on the physical damage claim` `a contract for a year from 1 June 2024, paid on signing` `cover with BS04` `a stolen mirror` `no additional-clause facts` EQUALS `payable` 15_300_000
-- Outside Vietnam: excluded (11.8) without BS05; with it in a named country, 25,500,000; theft
-- of the car there stays excluded by BS05(c).
#ASSERT `the answer on the physical damage claim` `a contract for a year from 1 June 2024, paid on signing` `cover of 500 million at full value` `a collision in Laos` `in a named country, with a permit` EQUALS `excluded` (LIST `art 11.8 outside Vietnam`)
#ASSERT `the answer on the physical damage claim` `a contract for a year from 1 June 2024, paid on signing` `cover with BS05` `a collision in Laos` `in a named country, with a permit` EQUALS `payable` 25_500_000
#ASSERT `the answer on the physical damage claim` `a contract for a year from 1 June 2024, paid on signing` `cover with BS05` `a theft of the car in Laos` `in a named country, with a permit` EQUALS `excluded` (LIST `BS05 theft in a country named on the certificate`)
-- BS10: no instructor aboard.
#ASSERT `the answer on the physical damage claim` `a contract for a year from 1 June 2024, paid on signing` `cover with BS10` `a collision on 1 September 2024` `a training car with no instructor aboard` EQUALS `excluded` (LIST `BS10 no instructor present, or no auxiliary brake`)
-- BS11: 22,000,000 + the item 10,000,000 = 32,000,000; less 500,000; plus 4,000,000 = 35,500,000.
#ASSERT `the answer on the physical damage claim` `a contract for a year from 1 June 2024, paid on signing` `cover of 500 million at full value` `a loss of added equipment` `a declared item of 10 million costing 15 million to replace` EQUALS `excluded` (LIST `art 15.8 added equipment`)
#ASSERT `the answer on the physical damage claim` `a contract for a year from 1 June 2024, paid on signing` `cover with BS11` `a loss of added equipment` `a declared item of 10 million costing 15 million to replace` EQUALS `payable` 35_500_000
-- BS13: its own special equipment, 25,500,000; an unsafe special vehicle stays excluded.
#ASSERT `the answer on the physical damage claim` `a contract for a year from 1 June 2024, paid on signing` `cover of 500 million at full value` `a loss from its own special equipment` `no additional-clause facts` EQUALS `excluded` (LIST `art 15.9 own special equipment`)
#ASSERT `the answer on the physical damage claim` `a contract for a year from 1 June 2024, paid on signing` `cover with BS13` `a loss from its own special equipment` `no additional-clause facts` EQUALS `payable` 25_500_000
#ASSERT `the answer on the physical damage claim` `a contract for a year from 1 June 2024, paid on signing` `cover with BS13` `a loss from its own special equipment` `an unsafe special vehicle` EQUALS `excluded` (LIST `art 15.9 own special equipment`, `BS13 unsafe vehicle, unlicensed operator, or rules broken`)
